If the criteria are met, call `request_human_review` for this URL with `pr_url`, `supplementary_review="{{ policy_id }}"`, and `supplementary_review_reason`: at most 240 characters, starting with High/Medium/Low impact and briefly naming the visible change and what needs review. Do not write a paragraph. Judge severity from user impact, not diff size. Screenshots already embedded in the PR description will be attached when possible; never invent screenshots.
